  "why": "LEARNINGS (ATL): Kenshin called BGs too loud at 7, 11 and 14 dB under the lead; v4 sat 18 dB under in 1-4 kHz (last version, not rejected). Brief: start LOW. Light = 20 dB (2 dB below the last unrejected value), fuller = 15 dB (5 dB step = clearly different by ear, still under the rejected 14 dB). Measured in 1-4 kHz, the band where he hears them (ATL lesson)"
 },
